# Windows batch / PowerShell scripts must be CRLF — cmd.exe misparses an
# LF-only .bat (labels, goto/call, multi-line blocks all break). Mark them
# -text so git stores the bytes exactly as committed (CRLF) and never
# converts on checkout, ZIP export, or a different core.autocrlf setting.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.ps1 -text
